<title>USA: Caliber System to cut 1,500 Viking jobs.</title>
<headline>Caliber System to cut 1,500 Viking jobs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Caliber System Inc said Thursday it would close 30 terminals and cut about 1,500 jobs in 1997 at its Viking Freight Inc unit amid a restructuring at the unit.</p>
<p>It said Viking would report an operating loss for the fourth quarter. The loss will be at about the same rate as in the third quarter and will have a negative impact on Caliber's corporate profits, Caliber said.</p>
<p>Caliber did not provide details but said it expects to be profitable for the quarter and full year.  </p>
<p>It also said it would freeze the wages of all Viking salaried employees for the first half of 1997.</p>
</text>
